This software, BJBank - Post-Quantum Cryptography in Mobile Banking, is released under a custom Academic Research License specifically designed for educational and research purposes related to cryptography, mobile security, and banking applications.

This license permits academic use while protecting the integrity of the research and preventing unauthorized commercial exploitation.

