PROJECT SCOPE & IMPLEMENTATION

The BJBank application implements 50+ banking features across 4 phases:

Phase 1: Core Banking (RF01-RF05)
  • Authentication & User Profile
  • Dashboard with real-time balance
  • Multiple accounts support
  • Transaction history with filters
  • Post-Quantum Cryptography integration

Phase 2: Financial Management (RF06-RF08)
  • Advanced card management (5 types)
  • Transfers (instant + scheduled)
  • Bill management & payments
  • MB WAY integration
  • OTP verification

Phase 3: Advanced Financial (RF09-RF10)
  • Loan management with amortization
  • Investment portfolio
  • Savings goals tracking
  • Budget management by category

Phase 4: Advanced Features (RF11-RF13)
  • Card blocking/unblocking
  • Push notifications (FCM)
  • QR code payments
  • Badge system (13 transaction types)

Technology Stack:
  • Flutter 3.8.1 + Dart 3.8+
  • Firebase (Auth, Firestore, Cloud Messaging)
  • Post-Quantum Cryptography (Kyber + ECDH secp256r1)
  • libOQS native library

